Comment:
 SLRXFM is a clean-room, from-scratch reimplementation of the behavior
 of the proprietary XandrosFileManager (Xandros Desktop 1.0, 2002).
 No code, decompiled or otherwise, from that or any other proprietary
 Xandros component is included in this package; see
 docs/CLEAN_ROOM.md in the upstream source (installed to
 /usr/share/doc/slrxfm/CLEAN_ROOM.md) for the methodology and evidence
 trail. No third-party code, fonts, or other bundled assets are
 included in this package; the application icon
 (data/icons/slrxfm.svg) is original artwork authored for this project.

